  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/master/icon.png\" width=\"150\"><br></p>\n<h1>实体声音特性 (Entity Sound Features)</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/esf-entity-sound-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fesf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>关于</h1>\n<p>ESF 是一个模组，允许基于 ETF / OptiFine 的 .properties 格式来变化实体的声音。</p>\n<p>ESF 还以声音属性和声音动画函数的形式，为 ETF 和 EMF 添加了额外的声音相关工具。</p>\n<h1>使用说明</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>有关如何变化现有播放声音的说明和示例，请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/blob/master/VARIATION.MD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">本指南</a></li>\n<li>有关如何使用为 ETF 和 EMF 添加的声音相关工具的说明，请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/blob/master/UTILITY.MD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">本指南</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1>更新日志</h1>\n<p>你可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/blob/master/CHANGELOG.MD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>找到更新日志。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>需要帮助或有问题？</h1>\n<p>你可以联系我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>（<em>推荐</em>）或在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/esf-entity-sound-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fesf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>托管合作伙伴优惠</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d641\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BVzZfTc1/images/bfb592538f8206a6a2d72d19c90714bea91b0e07.png\" alt=\"image\"></a></p>",
